NODE id=matrix/cortex/scope.memoryIDToBytes kind=func
  digest=b3:3b5d45dca64f4c96701b8dd316768bfd38fd55336116869c5d85d2d95b8ff342 file=cortex/scope/verify.go range=159:166 lang=go exported=false byte_range=5370:5667
  sig=func memoryIDToBytes(id memory.ID) [16]byte
  doc=memoryIDToBytes copies a memory.ID (which is [16]byte) into the\n[16]byte alias the snapshot package expects. Both are 16-byte\narrays; the alias is just a different named type so we re-cast.
